    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5omeday is an adventure game that was hosted on the free game posting site Unityroom and created at the game jam Unity1Week.<br><br>This game became very popular, earning high praise at the game jam and going viral via social media and gameplay videos, with some videos amassing over 3 million views.<br><br>Thanks to this, the game currently has reached over 300,000 total plays.<br><br>The Steam version currently offers multiple languages, including simplified Chinese, traditional Chinese, English, and voiced Japanese, and you can switch languages in-game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>If she tries anything shady or attempts to hurt you, push that button right in front of you.<br><strong>It will execute her instantly.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/fc461bf4a991038a3f36c2192f0dd913.poster.avif?t=1753539782\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/fc461bf4a991038a3f36c2192f0dd913.webm?t=1753539782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/fc461bf4a991038a3f36c2192f0dd913.mp4?t=1753539782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>\u30fbBasic controls are click-only.<br>\u30fb13 possible endings depending on your choices.<br>\u30fb1 play-through takes about 5 minutes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remake Changes</h2>This is a remake of the free game &quot;5omeday.&quot;<br><br>\u30fbNew character illustrations, voice recordings, scenario, stills, endings, and recorded music added.<br>\u30fbAddition of unlocked ending list and skip text feature<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2>Programming &amp; Scenario: Indigo Ingots<br>Art: polaritia<br>Sounds: Kazura's MUSIC<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note</h2>When streaming, please include the game title and the URL of this page in the summary field.",
